    "content": "<h2>Spacious Single-Level Living in Bella Via</h2><p>Single-level homes with more than 3,000 square feet are hard to find in the East Valley, and newer ones are even harder. <strong>10918 E Tripoli Avenue</strong> in Mesa's Bella Via community offers exactly that. Built in 2018 on a generous corner lot, the home has <strong>3,139 square feet</strong> on one floor, 3.5 bathrooms, a versatile bonus room and an attached 3-car garage. It is listed at <strong>$650,000</strong>.</p><p>The MLS lists 5 bedrooms. The listing remarks describe four bedrooms plus a bonus room, so the fifth space can work as a bedroom, home office, playroom or media room. That flexibility is what busy households want.</p><h2>Layout and Interior Features</h2><p>A <strong>welcoming entry courtyard</strong> leads into an expansive foyer and an open living area. The ranch-style plan puts the kitchen at the center of the home, flowing straight into the living and dining spaces, so cooking, homework and entertaining all happen together.</p><ul><li>Kitchen with <strong>granite countertops</strong>, an <strong>oversized island</strong>, breakfast bar seating and a pantry</li><li>Open-concept living and dining areas</li><li>Spacious <strong>primary suite</strong> with a large walk-in closet and a private bathroom with a walk-in shower</li><li>Versatile <strong>bonus room</strong> for an office, gym, playroom or guest space</li><li>Separate laundry room</li><li>Natural gas heating and central air</li><li>Attached <strong>3-car garage</strong> with room for vehicles, storage or a workshop</li></ul><p>Because everything is on one level, there are no stairs to climb. That suits young families, buyers planning to stay for years and anyone who values easy day-to-day living.</p><h2>Low-Maintenance Backyard</h2><p>The backyard is landscaped with <strong>artificial turf</strong> and enclosed by <strong>block fencing</strong>. That means a green, kid- and pet-friendly yard all year with no mowing, overseeding or summer watering. The corner lot adds a sense of space and separation from neighbors. There is also room to make the yard your own with a pool, a covered patio extension or an outdoor kitchen.</p><h2>Bella Via and Southeast Mesa</h2><p>Bella Via is a well-kept community in Mesa's fast-growing <strong>85212 zip code</strong>, an area that has become one of the East Valley's most active corridors. Residents are close to the <strong>Mesa Gateway Airport</strong> area and its growing employment base, and the Loop 202 San Tan Freeway connects them to Gilbert, Chandler, Queen Creek and the rest of the Valley. Shopping, dining and everyday errands are a short drive away, and the area's newer master-planned neighborhoods bring parks, walking paths and community events.</p><p>Southeast Mesa offers newer construction, larger lots and good value compared with neighboring Gilbert and Queen Creek. Families also have access to several public and charter school options in the area. Buyers should verify school boundaries for this specific address.</p><h2>Market Context: Is This a Good Value?</h2><p>At $650,000 for 3,139 square feet, the home is listed at about <strong>$207 per square foot</strong>. That is strong value for an eight-year-old single-level home with a 3-car garage in this part of the East Valley. Comparable new construction nearby often costs more per square foot and adds lot premiums, landscaping costs and long build times. This home already has finished landscaping and a 3-car garage, and buyers can move in on a resale timeline.</p><h2>Buy With Legal Oversight on Your Side</h2><p>Every Camelback Home Group transaction includes <strong>attorney and paralegal oversight</strong> at no additional cost. On a home like this, that means careful review of the purchase contract, HOA documents and CC&amp;Rs, title commitment, inspection-period deadlines and closing paperwork. You get real estate expertise and legal precision in one team.</p><h2>Schedule Your Showing</h2><p>Single-level homes of this size in Bella Via do not come up often. To see 10918 E Tripoli Avenue, Mesa, AZ 85212 in person, <strong>call Camelback Home Group at (480) 203-3039</strong> or <a href=\"/#contact\">reach out online</a>. We will set up a private showing and answer your questions about the home, the community and the Southeast Mesa market.</p>"
